The '''Fallen Star Lozenge''' is an {{Epic}} item that leads the player to the nearest [[Fallen Star]] while in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Fallen Star Lozenge''' can be obtained by speaking to {{NPCSprite|Silnar}} while wearing a {{Item|Fallen Star Helmet}}.

== Usage ==
